{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stihl-ride-on-lawn-mowers-2605-0119","content_id":"9a24abe9-54ed-424d-ab03-1ba78c709cca","description":"Product Recall for Stihl Ride-on Lawn Mowers presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"491bf3df-b04b-4efb-827c-af45732935f9","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-05-29T15:53:29+01:00","id":"491bf3df-b04b-4efb-827c-af45732935f9","title":"Link to product image and PDF ","updated_at":"2026-05-29T15:53:29+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19a869b95db968c8f3bc6b/2605-0119-product-recall-stihl-ride-on-lawn-mowers.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Stihl Ride-on Lawn Mowers</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire because leaks may occur in the fuel system of the EVC 7000 engine.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Stihl LTD.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Machinery - Lawn Mowers/Rakers (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Stihl</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>RT 4112.1 SZ, RT 5097.1 Z, RT 5112.1 Z and RT 6112.1 ZL</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Austria</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Orange and white ride-on lawn mowers.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_491bf3df-b04b-4efb-827c-af45732935f9\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a19a869b95db968c8f3bc6b/2605-0119-product-recall-stihl-ride-on-lawn-mowers.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF </a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire because leaks may occur in the fuel system of the EVC 7000 engine. If fuel escapes through the leaks, it could ignite and catch fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Stihl LTD.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately. To determine if your mower is affected by this recall or for more information, please visit: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.stihl.co.uk/en/news/important-information/recalls\">Recalls - STIHL</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2605-0119</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-01T09:16:12Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"machinery","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-05-29","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-06-01T10:16:12+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stihl-ride-on-lawn-mowers-2605-0119","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stihl-ride-on-lawn-mowers-2605-0119","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-stihl-r